                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "08c7bd6c-7b7a-38fa-9f3d-a4f745a596c6",
                                        "entry_id": "5ac1a680-e330-3eff-b277-5f0a04f1e7df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A young woman, especially one who is frivolous or vapid."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "66aa7de1-4cdc-4318-b71b-01fd9ba89d38",
                                                "sense_id": "08c7bd6c-7b7a-38fa-9f3d-a4f745a596c6",
                                                "text": "But really you get your money from selling things — that's your line, and your Dad's isn't it? Using sexy dollies to con money out of people who've had to work for it. Well my daughter's not just a sugar-plum fairy to titillate men's fantasies, you know."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "b3465fe8-7e70-4782-b52b-9ae030943fa0",
                                                "sense_id": "08c7bd6c-7b7a-38fa-9f3d-a4f745a596c6",
                                                "text": "This glorious collection should be passed around clubland as a textbook study in making a seamless transition from being a disco dolly to a serious pop vocalist."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c16f61f4-c302-313f-96db-f15e4037d84c",
                                        "entry_id": "5ac1a680-e330-3eff-b277-5f0a04f1e7df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A fashionable young woman, one who follows the latest music or clothing fashions."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "UK",
                                            "dated",
                                            "slang"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ac328256-364c-4cc3-b16a-d80895840690",
                                                "sense_id": "c16f61f4-c302-313f-96db-f15e4037d84c",
                                                "text": "Spotlight on the other hand is remarkable for prices and skirt lengths to suit the teenyboppers[…] Appeal: to a lunchtime horde of date-going dollies who cannot really afford another dress."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "6a249ce9-3d1a-35ec-973a-eaf9c8e2ac93",
                                        "entry_id": "5ac1a680-e330-3eff-b277-5f0a04f1e7df",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A ball hit by a batsman such that it goes gently to a fielder for a simple catch."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "dated"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7d973b71-62cf-331c-8d58-102671339593",
